<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Lynde Lou Lapad - Designer</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:system-ui}
body{background:#fff;color:#111;line-height:1.6}
nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;position:sticky;top:0;background:#fff}
.hero{padding:50px 20px;max-width:900px;margin:auto}
.hero-top{display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:25px}
.hero-top img{width:100px;height:100px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;border:3px solid #0a66c2}
.hero h1{font-size:36px;line-height:1.1}
.grid{padding:20px;max-width:900px;margin:auto;display:grid;gap:16px}
.card{background:#f7f6f4;padding:28px;border-radius:22px}
.contact{background:#111;color:#fff;padding:50px 20px;margin-top:40px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav><b>LLD.L.</b></nav>
<div class="hero">
<div class="hero-top">
<img src="profile.jpg" alt="Lynde Lou">
<div>
<h2>Lynde Lou D. Lapad</h2>
<p>Quezon, Bukidnon | ASTRA Buddy Creator</p>
</div>
</div>
<h1>Designer focused on clean brands and websites that convert.</h1>
<p>God-centered, deadline-driven, easy to work with.</p>
</div>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card"><h4>Local Cafe - Brand & Menu</h4><p>Branding & Menu Design</p></div>
<div class="card"><h4>Inventory Dashboard</h4><p>Web Design</p></div>
<div class="card"><h4>Business Portfolio</h4><p>Website Design</p></div>
</div>
<div class="contact">
<p>lyndelou.lapad.design@gmail.com</p>
<p>Quezon, Bukidnon</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
